# JavaScript sources are text, even when one holds a control character as data.
#
# `keySignature` in frontend/src/composables/useTaskIndex.js joins a compound key
# on NUL, and that byte was written into the source literally. Git's binary
# heuristic looks for exactly that byte, so the whole file was treated as binary
# and every diff on it rendered as "Binary files differ" — the change was
# invisible in review. The literal is now an escape, and this keeps any future
# one from hiding a diff again.
*.js diff
*.mjs diff
*.cjs diff
